            <ArticleTitle>[The pathophysiological basis for the treatment of patients with a vertebrogenic pain syndrome localized in the lumbosacral region].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Experience of treatment of 84 patients with radicular syndrome of lumbo-sacral localization revealed the efficacy of multifactorial effect on different structures of the nervous system responsible for generation and realization of pain impulsation. Treatment was carried out with consideration of pathogenetic factors forming the pain syndrome, namely, compression of the root, functional blocks, spinal reactive aseptic epiduritis, arterial dyscirculation, disorders of venous outflow, psychogenic factors.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
